.DS_Store

# The challenge brief stays local; docs/kickoff.md carries the requirements.
TASK.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
